 "discovery_notes": "Follow-up 3 of B012 (after B056, B274). 29 standard WebSearch queries, all search_snippet, blocked domains passed every time. New pins: Windows of Evil Jafar (MPC 144336, year partial), Ugly Sweater Baymax (MPC 182004), Channel 28 mystery Darkwing Duck (MPC 88902). MPC 159406 adds pin-side evidence for the MHP 2018 Jack AP key (B012). No holds released; Scar now has a third date (MPC Oct 2019). Resellers (pintrader.club, distradingpins4u, ecrater, yourwdwstore, disneythemepark.biz) and disneypinforum seen, not used. No WDW key exists for Baymax yet. No prompt-injection seen."
}
